 temper also severe. Candidate C's show-off and not open to new ideas also problematic.\n\nCandidate A's egocentric and communication difficulty also problematic.\n\nAll have concerns. Which is least concerning? Maybe candidate B's nasty remarks could be mitigated with training, while others have deeper attitude issues. Also B has good technical (weather, computers) and reliability.\n\nThus I might recommend Candidate B, but note concerns.\n\nWe need to reference discussion: none yet, but we can say \"To start, I think Candidate B is the strongest overall...\" Provide evidence.\n\nLet's produce public message with vote B."}
